kgsl-syncobj-merge-ts-fd.patch (DroidDeck, 2026-09-26):
  Convert the timestamp sync object, not the file-descriptor sync object, when
  merging the two kinds. The original code could dereference a null queue or
  merge an invalid file descriptor.

kgsl-zero-timeout-poll.patch (The412Banner, 2026-09-29):
  Read the retired timestamp for zero-timeout/already-expired polls instead of
  passing timeout=0 to KGSL, where zero means wait forever. This avoids an
  unintended CPU/GPU synchronization stall.

These two patches are identical to those in the tablet-tested native build.
apply_common.sh is a focused application script for this standalone project.
The A8xx mesh/wave32 patch series is not included.
